silica gel column chromatography (1:5 ethyl acetate−n-hexane), pure
N-methylcyclohexyl amine (0.198 g) was obtained as a colorless oil (37%).
1H NMR: 3.39 (br s, 1H), 2.75 (m, 1H), 2.52 (d, J = 8 Hz, 3H), 2.07 (m,
1H), 1.87 (m, 2H), 1.67 (m, 1H), 1.47−1.15 (m, 6H).
