$DATUM N 2, N 6 , N 6
,5,7-Pentamethyl-3-(phenylsulfonyl)pyrazolo[1,5-a]pyrimidine-2,6-diamine
(24) (Scheme 4). To a suspension of N
2,5,7-trimethyl-3-(phenylsulphonyl)pyrazolo[1,5-a]pyrimidine-2,6-diamine
(22) (75 g, 0.23 mol;) in 3750 mL of ethanol, a 3 M solution of 370 mL of
H2SO4 was added. The mixture was heated to 90 °C and then cooled to a
room temperature. Formalin solution (35%, 116.5 g, 1.4 mol) was added,
the mixture was stirred for 30 min, and NaBH4 (56 g, 1.5 mol) was added
portionwise to maintain the temperature below 25 ° C. After the reaction
was complete (LC-MS control), the precipitate was filtered, thoroughly
washed with water, and dried. Ethanol from the mother liquor was
evaporated in vacuo, and the additional precipitate of 24 was filtered,
washed with water, and dried. (yield: 97%). 24: 1H NMR (DMSO-d6 ) δ: 8.02
(m, 2H), 7.53 − 7.61 (m, 3H), 6.29 (br, 1H), 2.91 (s, 3H), 2.74 (s, 6H),
2.57 (s, 3H), 2.49 (s, 3H). HRMS calculated for C17H21N5O2S (M + H)
360.14942, found 360.1493. MS-ESI calculated for C17H21N5O2S (M + H) 360,
found m/z 360. LC-MS (UV-254), purity: 98%.
