$DATUM (S,E)-15-(((9H-Fluoren-9-yl)methoxy)carbonylamino)-5-(4-tert-butoxy-4-oxobut-2-enoyl)-10-methyl-2,4-dioxa-5,10-diazahexadecan-16-oic
acid 24. To a solution of the acid (0.727 g, 1.112 mmol, 1.0 eq.) in
methanol was added CH2O (2.0 eq., 37% in water solution). Then the
mixture was stirred at ambient temperature for 30 min followed by the
addition of the sodium cyanoborohydride (0.140 g, 2.223 mmol, 2.0 eq.)
and acetic acid (1.0 eq.). After the reaction was completed (monitored by
LC/MS), most of the solvent was removed by vacuum. Water was then added
and the reaction was diluted with ethyl acetate. The aqueous layer was
extracted with ethyl acetate (3 X 20mL) and the organic layer was dried
over sodium sulfate. Then removal of the solvent by vacuum. An oil (0.713
g, 1.068 mmol) in 96 % yield without further purification. IR (thin
film): υ 3401, 3054, 2939, 1715, 1659, 1634, 1451, 1394, 1368, 1306,
1258, 1153, 1082, 978, 926, 761, 741 cm-1; [α] = 7.9 (c = 1.0 g/L, 23
°C); 1H NMR (500 MHz, CD3OD) δ 7.80 (d, J = 7.5 Hz, 2H), 7.67 (dd, J =
11.1, 7.5 Hz, 2H), 7.48-7.37 (m, 3H), 7.31 (t, J = 7.4 Hz, 2H), 6.68 (d,
J = 15.6 Hz, 1H), 4.98 (s, 2H), 4.36 (qd, J = 10.6, 7.0 Hz, 2H), 4.22 (t,
J = 6.9 Hz, 1H), 4.15 (s, 1H), 3.83 (t, J = 6.4 Hz, 2H), 3.54 (s, 3H),
3.18-3.06 (m, 4H), 2.82 (s, 3H), 1.92 (m, 1H), 1.80-1.71 (m, 8H), 1.50
(s, 9H), 1.46 (m, 1H); 13C NMR (75MHz, CDCl3) δ 176.5, 164.6, 155.6,
144.2, 144.0, 141.2, 134.5, 131.0, 127.6, 127.0, 125.3, 125.2, 119.9,
101.6, 81.7, 66.4, 57.9, 56.0, 55.1, 48.5, 47.2, 32.4, 29.7, 28.0, 24.6,
24.0, 22.0, 20.6; HRMS (ESI): m/z: Calcd for C36H50N3O9 [M+H]+ 668.3542,
Found 668.3539.
