$DATUM (S)-2-{[3'-(4-Chloro-2,5-dimethylphenylsulfonylamino)-3,5-dimethyl-biphenyl-4-carbonyl]-amino}-4-dimethylamino-butyric
acid methyl ester hydrochloride (13). To a solution of 10 (2.00 g, 3.36
mmol) in methanol (67 ml) at 0 °C was added formaldehyde (37% in H2O,
0.90 ml, 12.09 mmol) followed by sodium cyanoborohydride (380 mg, 6.05
mmol). The reaction mixture was stirred at rt for 1.5 h. The mixture was
quenched with aq HCl (1 M) and stirred at rt for 15 min. The pH was
adjusted to ca. 9 by addition of saturated aq sodium bicarbonate and aq
sodium carbonate (2 M). The mixture was extracted with dichloromethane
(3x). The combined organic layers were washed with brine, dried over
magnesium sulfate, filtered and concentrated. The residue was purified by
flash chromatography (dichloromethane/methanol gradient) to provide a
white solid, which was dissolved in dichloromethane (5.0 mL) and treated
with an excess HCl (2 M in diethyl ether). Evaporation afforded 13. White
solid, yield (1.49 g, 2.39 mmol, 71%). 1H NMR (360 MHz, DMSO-d6): δ (ppm)
10.75 (br s, 1H), 10.64 (s, 1H), 8.93 (d, J= 7.1 Hz, 1H), 7.99 (s, 1H),
7.52 (s, 1H), 7.36-7.27 (m, 3H), 7.15 (s, 2H), 7.08 (m, 1 H), 4.58-4.55
(m, 1H), 3.73 (s, 3H), 3.26 (td, J= 12.0, 4.6 Hz, 1H), 3.08 (td, J= 12.0,
4.6 Hz, 1H), 2.76 (s, 6H), 2.56 (s, 3 H), 2.37 (s, 3H), 2.31-2.28 (m,
1H), 2.33 (s, 6H), 2.18-2.07 (m,1H). UPLC-MS m/z (ES+) (M+H)+= 586.4.
HRMS m/z (EI) (M+H)+= 586.2135 (calcd for C30H37ClN3O5S: 586.2142).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM An Oral Sphingosine 1-Phosphate Receptor 1 (S1P1) Antagonist Prodrug with
Efficacy in Vivo: Discovery, Synthesis, and Evaluation
