$DATUM This amine (0.028 g, 0.064 mmol) was dissolved in MeOH (1 mL).
Formaldehyde (37 wt% solution in H2O, 0.15 mmol, 12 μl) was added
followed by AcOH (0.26 mmol, 15 μl) and NaBH3CN (0.008 g, 0.13 mmol). The
mixture was stirred at room temperature for 2 hours before concentrating
under vacuum. Purification by prep HPLC. 24 (0.017 g, 57% yield) as a
white solid.
3-(4-(Dimethylamino)-1-(5-methyl-7H-pyrrolo[2,3-d]pyrimidin-4-yl)piperidine-4-carboxamido)phenyl
dimethylcarbamate (24). 1H NMR (400 MHz, METHANOL-d 4) δ ppm 8.21 (s,
1H), 7.56 (m, 1H), 7.46 (m, 1H), 7.37 (m, 1H), 7.03 (d, J = 1.0Hz, 1H),
6.92 (m, 1H), 4.08 (m, 2H), 3.47 (m, 2H), 3.17 (s, 3H), 3.04 (s, 3H),
2.48 (s, 3H), 2.40 (s, 6H), 2.26 (m, 2H), 2.09 (m, 2H); MS (ES+) [M+H]+ =
466.
