$DATUM tert-Butyl
3-[3-(Methylamino)-5,11-dioxo-5H-indeno[1,2-c]isoquinolin-6(11H)-yl]propylcarbamate
(25) and tert-Butyl
3-[3-(Dimethylamino)-5,11-dioxo-5H-indeno[1,2-c]isoquinolin-6(11H)-yl]propylcarbamate
(26). Compound 17 (0.22 g, 0.52 mmol) was dissolved in acetic acid (50
mL) and methanol (2 mL), and 37% aqueous formaldehyde (0.015 g, 0.442
mmol) was added to the reaction mixture, which was stirred at room
temperature for 4 h, before sodium cyanoborohydride (0.062 g, 1.04 mmol)
was added and stirring continued for another 1 h. The solvents were
removed under vacuum, and the residue was washed with aqueous sodium
bicarbonate (2 x 15 mL), extracted with CHCl3 (2 x 60 mL), and the
combined organic layer was dried over sodium sulfate and concentrated to
get a crude product. The crude product was purified by silica gel column
chromatography, eluting with chloroform, to afford monomethylated
compound 25 and dimethylated compound 26. Yield, compound 25: (45 mg,
20%), compound 26: (100 mg, 42%). Compound 25: mp 210-211 °C, IR (KBr)
3583, 3381, 2986, 1697, 1641, 1617, 1578, 1521, 1422, 1317, 1274, 1164,
754, 665 cm-1; 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ 8.50 (d, J = 8.7 Hz, 1 H), 7.54
(d, J = 7.2 Hz, 1 H), 7.35 (m, 3 H), 7.27 (m, 2 H), 7.04 (dd, J = 2.6,
8.7 Hz, 1 H), 5.42 (br s, 1 H), 4.57 (t, J = 6.6 Hz, 2 H), 4.10 (br s, 1
H), 3.23 (m, 2 H), 2.94 (s, 3 H), 2.07 (m, 2 H), 1.45 (s, 9 H); 13C NMR
(125 MHz, CDCl3) δ 191.0, 163.7, 156.1, 150.9, 148.6, 137.8, 134.9,
133.2, 130.0, 125.1, 124.7, 123.2, 123.0, 121.9, 121.5, 109.9, 106.4,
79.2, 41.6, 37.2, 30.5, 30.2, 28.4; ESIMS (m/z, relative intensity) 434
(MH+, 67), 456, (MNa+, 18), 335 (100); HRESIMS expected for C25H27N3O4
m/z 434.2080 (MH+), found 434.2073 (MH+); HPLC purity: 95.46 % (C18
reverse phase, MeOH-H2O, 90:10). Compound 26: mp 207-209 °C. IR (KBr)
3583, 3369, 2975, 1699, 1649, 1614, 1578, 1517, 1390, 1364, 1169, 758,
666 cm-1; 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ 8.56 (d, J = 9.0 Hz, 1 H), 7.71 (m, 1
H), 7.46 (d, J = 2.8 Hz, 1 H), 7.38 (m, 2 H), 7.26 (m, 1 H), 7.22 (dd, J
= 2.8, 9.0 Hz), 5.49 (m, 1 H), 4.58 (t, J = 6.7 Hz, 2 H), 3.23 (m, 2 H),
3.07 (s, 6 H), 2.05 (m, 2 H), 1.45 (s, 9 H); 13C NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3) δ
191.0, 163.7, 156.1, 150.7, 149.5, 137.8, 134.9, 133.2, 129.8, 124.7,
124.6, 122.9, 121.9, 121.4, 120.0, 109.7, 107.9, 79.2, 41.6, 40.3, 37.2,
30.2, 28.4; ESIMS (m/z, relative intensity) 448 (MH+, 37), 348 (94);
HRESIMS expected for C26H29N3O4 m/z 448.2236 (MH+), found 448.2233 (MH+);
HPLC purity: 95.41 % (C18 reverse phase, MeOH-H2O, 90:10)
