$DATUM Ethyl 2-(4-Ethylmorpholin-3-yl)acetate (3). A mixture of ethyl
2-(morpholin-3-yl)acetate (2) (0.300 g; 1.73 mmol), sodium acetate (0.226
g; 2.75 mmol), and acetaldehyde (0.291 mL; 5.19 mmol) in MeOH (2 mL) was
stirred at room temperature for 1 h. The reaction mixture was
concentrated under reduced pressure. The residue was taken up with EtOAc,
dried over Na2SO4, filtered, and concentrated under reduced pressure. The
residue was purified by flash chromatography on silica gel using a
gradient of MeOH (0 to 10%) in CH2Cl2. 0.256 g (73%) of the title
compound as a yellow oil. ESI/APCI(+): 202 (M + H).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
