$DATUM (R)-1-(Ethylamino)propan-2-ol (13). To a solution of
(R)-1-amino-2-propanol (1.83 g, 24.4 mmol) in EtOH (24 mL) cooled at 0 °C
was added acetaldehyde (1.37 mL; 24.4 mmol). After 50 min at 0 °C, NaBH4
(1.83 g; 48.4 mmol) was added portionwise and the reaction mixture was
stirred at 0 °C for 1 h. The reaction was quenched by addition of water.
After addition of Et2O, the solids were filtered. The filtrate was
concentrated under reduced pressure. The residue was taken up with Et2O,
dried over Na2SO4, filtered and concentrated under reduced pressure. The
residue was purified by distillation under reduced pressure. 1.53 g (61%)
of the title compound as a colourless liquid. ESI/APCI(+): 104 (M+H). 1H
NMR (CDCl3, 300 MHz) δ 3.80 (1H, m); 2.66 (2H, m); 2.43 (2H, m); 1.16
(3H, d); 1.11 (3H, t).
