$DATUM (S)-1-(Ethylamino)propan-2-ol (12). To a solution of
(S)-1-amino-2-propanol (1.27 g, 16.9 mmol) in EtOH (16.5 mL) cooled at 0
°C was added acetaldehyde (0.948 mL; 18.3 mmol). After 45 min at 0 °C,
NaBH4 (1.27 g; 33.6 mmol) was added portionwise and the reaction mixture
was stirred at 0 °C for 1 h. The reaction was quenched by addition of
water. After addition of EtOAc, the solids were filtered. The filtrate
was concentrated under reduced pressure. The residue was taken up with
Et2O, dried over Na2SO4, filtered and concentrated under reduced
pressure. The residue was purified by distillation under reduced
pressure. 0.692 g (40%) of the title compound as a colourless liquid.
ESI/APCI(+): 104 (M+H).
