$DATUM Synthesis of N-Propyl-1,4-dioxaspiro[4.5]decan-8-amine (20).
1,4-Cyclohexanedione monoethylene ketal (10 g, 64.03 mmol) was reacted
with n-propylamine (10.5 mL, 128.06 mmol) in the presence of NaCNBH3
(10.06 g, 160.07 mmol) and HOAc (7.6 mL) in 1,2-dichloroethane (100 mL)
by following procedure A. The crude reaction mixture was purified by
column chromatography on silica gel column using solvent system
dichloromethane/methanol (100:1) to yield 12.04 g of pure compound 20
(94%). 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3): δ 0.91 (t, 3H, J = 7.2 Hz), 1.36-1.59 (m,
6H), 1.74-1.79 (m, 2H), 1.84-1.89 (m, 2H), 2.49-2.60 (m, 3H), 3.94 (s,
4H, -O(CH 2)2O-).
