N6-(2-(4-(1H-Indol-5-yl)piperazin-1-yl)ethyl)-N6-propyl-4,5,6,7-tetrahydrobenzo[d]thiazole-2,6-diamine
Analogues: Development of Highly Selective D3 Dopamine Receptor Agonists
along with a Highly Potent D2/D3 Agonist and Their Pharmacological
Characterization
