$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: General procedure F To a solution of a
morpholin-2-one (1.0 eq) in THF (5 mL/mmol) and CH3CN (14 mL/mmol) was
added an aldehyde or a ketone (5.0 eq). After 15 min at room temperature,
NaBH3CN (2.0 eq) was added portionwise. The reaction mixture was stirred
for an additional 15 min and acetic acid (2.1 eq) was added. The reaction
mixture was stirred at room temperature for 1-18 h. The reaction was
quenched by addition of saturated NaHCO3. The reaction mixture was
diluted with EtOAc and the phases were separated. The organic phase was
washed with water and brine, dried over Na2SO4, filtered and
concentrated. The residue was purified by flash chromatography on silica
gel to give the desired compound.
2-(6,6-Dimethyl-2-oxo-4-propylmorpholin-3-yl)-N-(4-isopropylphenyl)acetamide
(46). The compound was prepared according to the procedure F from 44
(0.080 g; 0.263 mmol), propionaldehyde (0.095 mL; 1.33 mmol), NaBH3CN
(0.033 g; 0.525 mmol) and acetic acid (0.031 mL; 0.542 mmol) in THF (1.4
mL) and CH3CN (3.8 mL). Purification by flash chromatography on silica
gel using a gradient of EtOAc (20 to 70%) in heptane.
2-(4-Isopropyl-6,6-dimethyl-2-oxomorpholin-3-yl)-N-(4-isopropylphenyl)acetamide
(47). The compound was prepared according to the procedure F from 44
(0.080 g; 0.263 mmol), acetone (0.097 mL, 1.32 mmol), NaBH3CN (0.033 g;
0.525 mmol) and acetic acid (0.031 mL; 0.542 mmol) in THF (1.4 mL) and
CH3CN (3.8 mL). Purification by flash chromatography on silica gel using
a gradient of EtOAc (20 to 90%) in heptane. 0.007 g (8%) of the title
compound as a white solid. ESI/APCI(+): 347 (M+H); 369 (M+Na); 715
(2M+Na). 1H NMR (CDCl3, 300 MHz) δ 8.52 (1H, s); 7.40 (2H, m); 7.16 (2H,
d); 3.62 (1H, m); 3.39 (1H, m); 2.85-3.15 (3H, m); 2.81 (1H, d); 2.42
(1H, d); 1.45 (3H, s); 1.41 (3H, s); 1.22 (6H, d); 1.17 (3H, d); 0.95
(3H, d).
