$DATUM General Procedure for Morpholin-2-one Formation. Exemplified for
4-Ethyl-6,6-dimethylmorpholin-2-one (23). To a mixture of a 40% glyoxal
solution in water (4.5 mL; 39.2 mmol) in toluene (20 mL) cooled at 10 °C
was added a solution of 16 (4.4 g; 37.7 mmol) in toluene (11 mL). After 2
h at 10 °C, the reaction mixture was refluxed to azeotrope out solvents.
Purification by distillation under reduced pressure. 4.72 g (80%) of the
title compound as a colorless liquid. ESI/APCI(+): 158 (M + H); 180 (M +
Na). 1H NMR (CDCl3, 300 MHz) δ 3.21 (2H, s), 2.47 (2H, s), 2.44 (2H, q, J
= 7.3 Hz), 1.43 (6H, s), 1.09 (3H, t, J = 7.3 Hz). 13C NMR (CDCl3, 300
MHz) δ 168.5, 99.8, 81.5, 59.3, 54.6, 51.0, 26.9, 11.7.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
