$DATUM (S)-4-Ethyl-6-phenylmorpholin-2-one (21). To a mixture of a 40% glyoxal
solution in water (0.548 mL; 4.82 mmol) and toluene (2 mL) cooled at 10
°C was added a solution of 14 (0.775 g; 4.69 mmol) in toluene (2 mL).
After 2 h at 10 °C, the reaction mixture was heated at reflux to
azeotrope out solvents. The residue was partitioned between EtOAc and
water. The aqueous phase was extracted with EtOAc. The organic phases
were combined, washed with brine, dried over Na2SO4, filtered and
concentrated under reduced pressure. Purification by flash chromatography
on silica gel using a gradient of EtOAc (20 to 50%) in heptane. 0.486 g
(50%) of the title compound as a yellow oil. ESI/APCI(+): 206 (M+H); 228
(M+Na).
