Hz, 2H), 6.60 (d, J = 8.5 Hz, 2H),6.49 (t, J = 6.5 Hz, 1H), 5.87 (s, 2H),
5.50 (bs, 2H), 4.36(d, J = 6.5 Hz, 2H), 4.31 (s, 2H), 3.93 (s, 2H). MS
(ESI)m/z ) 447 [M + H]+, 445 [M - H]-. Anal. (C24H23ClN6O.
