$DATUM To Cbz-Val-OH (16) (50.0 g, 199 mmol), N,O-dimethylhydroxylamine
hydrochloride (38.8 g, 398 mmol) and EDC· HCl (47.7 g, 249 mmol) in DCM
(500 mL) was added DIPEA (87 mL, 497 mmol), and the reaction mixture
stirred at ambient temperature for 20 h, after which time it was diluted
with DCM (200 mL), washed with 1 M HCl (aq) (3 × 200 mL), 1 M NaOH (aq)
(200 mL), saturated NaHCO3 (aq) (200 mL), and brine (300 mL). The organic
layer was dried over MgSO4, filtered, and the solvent removed under
vacuum. The desired compound as a colorless oil (51.2 g). MS [M + H]+ 295
