Ohmiya, Tadamasa; Shimizu, Hideo; Saito, Takao; Sayo, Noboru
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Process Research & Development (2011), 15(5), 1130-1137

