N-Oxide (11). A mixture of (+)10 (3.32 g, 7.05 mmol), pyridylacetic acid
N-oxide (2.38 g, 15.5 mmol), HOBT (1.92 g, 14.2 mmol), DEC (2.70 g, 14.1
mmol), N-methylmorpholine (1.56 mL, 14.2 mmol), and dry DMF (50 mL) was
