$DATUM 3-(3,4-Dihydro-6-methyl-4-oxo-3-phenyl-2-thioxopyrimidin-1(2H)-yl)-2
methylquinazolin-4(3H)-one (16) To a solution of compound 4 (3.11 g, 0.01
mol) in dioxane (30 mL) containing piperidine (0.5 mL), acetylacetone
(1.00 g, 0.01 mol) was added. The reaction mixture was heated under
reflux for 3 h, and then excess solvent was distilled off. The formed
solid product was collected by filtration, dried, and crystallized from
ethanol. Yield 2.10 g, 56 %. M.p. 240 °C; IR (KBr) ν /cm-1: 3,100
(CH-aromatic), 2,899 (CH3), 1,680 (C=N), 1,675 (C=O), 1,245 (C=S); MS m/z
(%) 376 [M+, 0.62 %]; 1H-NMR δ : 6.92-7.55 (m, 9H, Ar-H), 6.59 (d, 1H,
pyrimidine H-5), 4.89 (s, 1H, pyrimidine H-4), 3.80 (s, 3H,
pyrimidine-CH3), 3.68 (s, 3H, pyrimidine-CH3), 3.31 (s, 3H,
quinazolinone-CH3); 13C-NMR δ : 17.3, 19.7 (2 CH3, pyrimidine), 20.9
(quinazolinone-CH3), 120.9, 124.8, 128.8, 127.4, 133.5, 122.4, 147.1,
126.5, 129.1, 140.3 (benzene), 54.8, 99.8, 145.3 (pyrimidine), 161.0
(C=O, quinazolinone), 164.2 (C-CH3-quinazolinone), 178.2 (C=S); Anal.
Cald. for C21H2ON4OS (376.47): C, 67.00; H, 5.35; N, 14.88; S, 8.52 %.
Found: C, 67.09; H, 5.29; N, 14.78; S, 8.49 %.
