$DATUM (R)-3-(Naphthalene-7-sulfonamido)-3-phenyl-N-((R)-5-
(piperidin-1-ylmethyl)-2,3-dihydro-1H-inden-1-yl)propanamide
hydrochloride (24). A 5 mL conical vial was charged with a spin vane and
(R)-N-((R)-5-formyl-2,3-dihydro-1H-inden-1-yl)-3-(naphthalene-7-sulfonamido)-3-phenylpropanamide
(0.0834 g, 0.17 mmol). The vessel was dried at 0.12 mmHg at 60 °C for 1
h. To the solid was added 1 mL DCE, glacial acetic acid (0.014 ml, 0.25
mmol), and piperidine (0.025 ml, 0.25 mmol). The slurry was sonicated for
5 min, and stirred at room temperature for 15 min. To the heterogenous
solution was added sodium triacetoxyborohydride (0.071 g, 0.33 mmol). The
vessel was then sealed and placed in a 50 °C oil bath for 16 h. The
reaction became clear within 2 h. The reaction was cooled and treated
with Si-propylsulfonic acid (Silicycle, Inc., 0.46 g, 0.33 mmol). The
slurry was stirred at room temperature for 1 h, and filtered. The silica
was washed with 25 mL each of 20% EtOH in THF followed by 20% (2M NH3 in
EtOH)- 80% THF. The combined filtrates were concentrated in vacuo and
loaded onto a 30 X 100 mm Waters Xterra Prep C18 OBD column (100 Å pore
diameter, 5 μm particle size, spherical shape, PN 186001942; Gradient: 0
→ 5 min@35 mL/min, 25% B; 5 → 20 min@35 mL/min, linear gradient to 55% B;
20 → 24.9@35 mL/min, isocratic at 55%B, 25 → 29.9 min@35 mL/min, step to
100%B; 30 → 40 min@35 mL/min, step to 25%B; 40 min end). A = 10 mM HOAc
in water, B = 10 mM HOAc in MeOH. A band that eluted from 13.2 - 16 min
was isolated. The methanol was removed in vacuo. The aqueous solution was
treated with 0.5 mL HCl (2N) and lyophilized to afford
(R)-3-(naphthalene-7-sulfonamido)-3-phenylN-((R)-5-(piperidin-1-ylmethyl)-2,3-dihydro-1H-inden-1-
yl)propanamide hydrochloride 24 (0.0600 g, 59% yield).
(R)-3-(naphthalene-7-sulfonamido)-3-phenylN-((R)-5-(piperidin-1-ylmethyl)-2,3-dihydro-1H-inden-1-
yl)propanamide hydrochloride 24 (0.0600 g, 59% yield). 1H NMR (400 MHz,
MeOH-d4) δ ppm 1.47 (qt, J = 12.44, 3.86, 3.62 Hz, 1 H) 1.64 - 1.85 (m, 4
H) 1.90 (d, J = 14.67 Hz, 2 H) 2.32 - 2.44 (m, J = 12.72, 7.83, 7.83,
3.13 Hz, 1 H) 2.67 (dd, J = 13.89, 8.61 Hz, 1 H) 2.74 (dd, J = 13.69,
7.04 Hz, 1 H) 2.77 - 2.85 (m, 1 H) 2.85 - 2.98 (m, 3 H) 3.37 (d, J =
10.37 Hz, 2 H) 4.19 (s, 2 H) 4.88 (dd, J = 8.31, 7.24 Hz, 1 H) 5.19 (q, J
= 7.92 Hz, 1 H) 6.55 (d, J = 7.73 Hz, 1 H) 6.93 - 7.03 (m, 3 H) 7.07 -
7.13 (m, 3 H) 7.29 (s, 1 H) 7.58 (td, J = 7.43, 1.56 Hz, 1 H) 7.62 (td, J
= 7.73, 1.56 Hz, 1 H) 7.64 (dd, J = 8.71, 1.86 Hz, 1 H) 7.82 (d, J = 8.80
Hz, 1 H) 7.88 (d, J = 8.41 Hz, 2 H) 8.17 (d, J = 1.47 Hz, 1 H). 13C NMR
(101 MHz, MeOH-d4) δ ppm 22.85 (s, 1 C) 24.19 (s, 2 C) 30.98 (s, 1 C)
34.14 (s, 2 C) 45.11 (s, 1 C) 53.98 (s, 1 C) 54.04 (s, 1 C) 55.34 (s, 1
C) 57.26 (s, 1 C) 123.55 (s, 1 C) 125.95 (s, 1 C) 128.37 (s, 2 C) 128.49
(s, 2 C) 128.65 (s, 1 C) 128.96 (s, 1 C) 129.34 (s, 1 C) 129.40 (s, 2 C)
129.73 (s, 1 C) 129.75 (s, 1 C) 130.21 (s, 1 C) 130.32 (s, 1 C) 130.77
(s, 1 C) 133.54 (s, 1 C) 136.10 (s, 1 C) 139.55 (s, 1 C) 141.25 (s, 1 C)
145.70 (s, 1 C) 146.93 (s, 1 C) 171.88 (s, 1 C). Anal. Calcd for
C34H37N3O3S .0.7 H2O.1.0 HCl: C, 66.21; H, 6.44; N, 6.77. Found: C, 66.17
±0.02; H, 6.43 ±0.00; N, 6.77 ±0.01. HRMS: calcd for C34H37N3O3S + H+,
568.26284; found 568.26381. IR (KBr): υmax 3422.4, 3385.6, 3258.8,
3055.4, 2927.44, 2573.3, 2538.0, 1665.5,1647.4, 1535.5, 1455.9, 1318.5,
1238., 1155.5, 1131.1, 1098.7, 936.4, 900.6 cm-1. [α]D 25.7°= +96.2 (c =
0.63, MeOH). HPLC-MS: Peaks: 5.68 min (99.5%@215 nm; 99.0% @254 nm; m/z =
568.2, calcd for C34H37N3O3S +H+ = 568.3); 6.20 min (0.5%@215 nm; 1% @254
nm).
