N-(azetidin-3-y)-N-(4-(trifluoromethyl)benzyl)aniline
2,2,2-trifluoroacetate (10cu) Yield 36%. m.p. 148 °C; 1H NMR (400MHz,
CDCl3) δ 3.26 (m, 1H, CH), 3.71-3.77 (m, 4H, azetidine H, CHCH2), 4.03
