$DATUM tert-Butyl
(1s,4s)-4-(5-fluoro-2-(4'-hydroxy-2'-(morpholinomethyl)bipheny3-yloxy)nicotinamido)cyclohexylcarbamate
35 [General Method J]. To a solution of 32 (2.00 g, 1 eq) in CH2Cl2 (40
mL) were added morpholine (1.3 mL, 4 eq) and acetic acid (0.21 mL, 1 eq).
The mixture was stirred at rt for 40 min then methanol (10 mL) was added.
After a further 10 min sodium triacetoxyborohydride (1.54 g, 2.1 eq) was
added and the mixture stirred for 1 h. The mixture was diluted with
CH2Cl2 and washed with saturated aqueous NaHCO3 (x 2), dried (MgSO4) and
concentrated to give a 32. Foam, yield 2.20 g, 97%. 1H NMR (400 MHz,
CDCl3, δ): 8.36 (dd, J = 8.2, 3.1 Hz, 1H), 8.06 (d, J = 3.1 Hz, 1H), 8.02
(d, J = 7.4 Hz, 1H), 7.51 - 7.44 (m, 1H), 7.32 - 7.27 (m, 1H), 7.23 -
7.16 (m, 2H), 7.15 - 7.10 (m, 1H), 7.07 - 7.00 (m, 1H), 6.80 (dd, J =
8.3, 2.7 Hz, 1H), 4.53 - 4.41 (m, 1H), 4.22 - 4.10 (m, 1H), 3.80 - 3.70
(m, 1H), 3.67 - 3.52 (m, 4H), 3.40 (s, 2H), 2.42 - 2.29 (m, 4H), 1.89 -
1.45 (m, 8H), 1.41 (s, 9H). LRMS: m/z 621 [M+H]+.
