oil. 1H NMR (400MHz, CDCl3) δ 1.09-1.85 (m, 10H, cyclohexyl H), 2.43 (m,
1H, cyclohexyl C1H), 2.74 (m, 3H, CH, CHCH2), 3.34 (m, 2H, azetidine H),
3.55 (s, 2H, NCH2), 3.66 (m, 2H, azetidine H), 7.00-7.19 (m, 3H, ArH);
The 13C NMR data could not be obtained due to lack of the sample.
