$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: N-(O-t-Butyl-(S)-α-aspartyl)-2(S)-{2-[N-(N,
N'-di-t-butoxycarbonylamidino)-4-piperidyloxy]ethyl}piperidine (51a).
Piperidine (1.7 mL, 18.3 mmol) was added to a stirred solution of
Fmoc-amine 50a (1.55 g, 1.83 mmol) in THF (7.5 mL). After 1 h, the
reaction mixture was evaporated under reduced pressure and the residue
was purified by chromatog- raphy on silica gel, using CH2Cl2-MeOH-0.88NH3
(193:7:1) as eluant.
N-(N-Cyclohexyl-O-t-butyl-(S)-α-glutamyl)-2(S)-{2-[N-(N,
N'-di-t-butoxycarbonyl-amidino)-4-piperidyloxy]-ethyl}piperidine (58).
Yield = (847 mg, 88%) as a white foam. Rf 0.32 (hexanes:EtOAc,
1:1);[α]D-6.3° (c) 0.79, MeOH). 1H NMR (CDCl3): δ 0.94-2.02 (m, 23 H),
1.42 (s, 9 H), 1.46 (s, 18 H), 2.08-2.73 (m, 4 H), 3.10 (t, 0.5 H),
3.28-3.63 (m, 7 H), 3.66-3.88 (m, 3 H), 4.22 (br s, 0.5 H), 4.53 (d, 0.5
H), 4.87 (br s, 0.5 H), 10.0 (vbr s, 1 H). LRMS: m/z 723 (M + H)+. Anal.
(C38H67N5O8) H, N; C: calcd, 63.22; found, 62.75.
